1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:08,525
If a family member notices a senior's card turning yellow or red, clicking on that card brings up a quick-action drawer.

2
00:00:08,525 --> 00:00:23,423
There are two primary shortcuts: 'Direct Call,' which instantly rings the senior's phone, and 'Preset SMS,' which opens a gentle text message saying, 'Hi Mom, just checking in—please remember to tap your check-in button!

3
00:00:23,423 --> 00:00:28,637
' It's respectful, warm, and requires no copying or pasting of phone numbers.

4
00:00:28,637 --> 00:00:30,871
Communication takes just one tap.
